@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11

|Warehouse Robot|
start
:Receive assigned sub-order\nand locations in own aisle;
while (Medicines left to collect?) is ([yes])
  :Take empty collection bin;
  :Execute AD10 Register collection bin;
  while (Bin has capacity and\nmedicines remain?) is ([yes])
    :Go to next product location;
    :Collect requested medicines;
  endwhile ([no])
  :Place full or partly filled bin\non conveyor to distribution area;
endwhile ([no])
:Execute AD11 Complete sub-order;
|System|
:Make bin and sub-order status\navailable to distribution employee;
stop
@enduml
